# Code & Design Directives

- Run `npm run typecheck` before finishing any task. Zero TypeScript errors allowed.
- Keep components modular and strictly under 120 lines.
- Canvas is `#F4F6F9`, cards are pure white with `border-slate-200/80 rounded-xl shadow-xs`.
- All clickable items must have `cursor-pointer` and `transition-all duration-150 ease-in-out`.
- Never stretch or squash media/logos: use strict aspect ratios.
